---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="GTA Online Brand Wars Event continues! The Gallivanter Warden is now available to all. Earn 5X on VIP Work this weekend, 4X on Hotring Circuit races, and claim Twitch Drop rewards."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">August 20, 2026 — August 26, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    The <span style="color: var(--accent-orange); font-weight: 700;">Brand Wars Event</span> continues! The new Gallivanter Warden is now available to everyone. Link your Twitch account for Drops, grab free Sprunk/eCola gear and the Hotring Sabre, and earn a massive <span style="color: var(--accent-pink); font-weight: 700;">5X GTA$ & RP</span> on VIP Work from August 21-23.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Win 3 Races to get the Princess Racing Tracksuit along with GTA$250,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Brand Wars Twitch Drops (Aug 13–26):</strong> Watch participating streams to support Team Sprunk or Team eCola and claim suits plus up to GTA$2,000,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Free Unlocks:</strong> Sprunk and eCola Bodysuits at clothing stores, plus Sprunk x eCola livery & vanity plates at Vehicle Workshops</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>New Vehicle:</strong> The Gallivanter Warden (SUV) is now available to everyone at Legendary Motorsport & PDM</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">5X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> VIP Work (August 21-23 Only)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">4X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Hotring Circuit Series, Freemode Challenges, and Freemode Events</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Select Odd Jobs (Paper Route, Firefighter, Forklift Operator, QuickiePharm, Safeguard Deliveries)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Community Series</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FREE:</strong> Declasse Hotring Sabre</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>40% OFF:</strong> Bail Office Properties (including Upgrades & Modifications), Bravado Hotring Hellfire, Declasse Scramjet, and Karin Hotring Everon</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Canis Terminus, Dinka RT3000, Dinka Veto Modern, Emperor ETR1, MTL Wastelander, Pfister Comet S2, Übermacht Sentinel Classic, Vapid Desert Raid, Vapid Trophy Truck, Western Reever, and Willard Eudora</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (FREE):</strong> Knife</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (40% OFF):</strong> Unholy Hellbringer</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (40% OFF GTA+):</strong> Railgun</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Up-n-Atomizer, The Shocker, Combat Shotgun, Heavy Sniper, Pump Shotgun, Molotovs, Pipe Bombs & Sticky Bombs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Declasse Granger 3600LX</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Enus Paragon R (Place Top 3 in the LS Car Meet Series for two days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Gallivanter Warden, Vapid Desert Raid, Willard Eudora, Canis Terminus & Emperor ETR1</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Declasse Scramjet (Impotent Rage livery) & Declasse Scramjet (Princess Robot Bubblegum livery)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Pfister Comet S2, Dinka Veto Modern & Western Reever</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Pfister Astron Custom</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Taking Off</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Fort Zancudo (Standard) & Pacific Bluffs to Mount Gordo (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> True Love, Pumpkin, A Winding Road Home</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Brute Force File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The McTony Robbery - Bravado Buffalo STX</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Gangbanger Robbery - Willard Eudora</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Cargo Ship Robbery - Vapid Ellie</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>